        "id": 1123814
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-07T17:01:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is used in common/i2c.c and must be defined. It\u0027s a chip specific setting and I see it defined in other config_chip.h files. Since its describing the number of I2C ports supported by H1, I thought it made sense to define here.",
